# Test: ze explain surfaces the OSPF config-sanity doctor diagnostics.
# VALIDATES: spec-ospf-13 AC-14 -- the two config-sanity codes
# (doctor-ospf-router-id-missing, doctor-ospf-interface-area-unbound) are registered by
# the ospf component and explainable. The check-execution logic is covered by
# internal/plugins/ospf/doctor_test.go (TestOSPFDoctorConfigSanity).
# PREVENTS: the config-sanity codes regressing to unregistered/unexplainable.

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze explain doctor-ospf-router-id-missing:exit=0
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=doctor-ospf-router-id-missing
expect=stdout:contains=router-id

cmd=foreground:seq=2:exec=ze explain doctor-ospf-interface-area-unbound:exit=0
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=doctor-ospf-interface-area-unbound
expect=stdout:contains=undeclared area
